Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[TextData[StyleBox["ML_predict_xsec",
 FontWeight->"Bold"]], "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.875922571008416*^9, 3.875922626363906*^9}, 
   3.8833288049909973`*^9, {3.9009341111373243`*^9, 3.9009341351727605`*^9}, {
   3.901387413188305*^9, 3.901387414123789*^9}},
 FontWeight->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"5260118b-2edd-4eb9-95d2-586fdf210e4a"],

Cell["A. L. Harris", "Subtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9009341405889883`*^9, 3.9009341550944085`*^9}, 
   3.9013874074917126`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1cdcca80-aac1-430b-a7d1-\
34ae48819a53"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This Mathematica code was used to produce the predicted data published in  \
https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2309.02538.  ",
 StyleBox["Please cite this code as:  A. L. Harris and J. Nepomuceno, doi: \
10.6084/m9.figshare.24082035  and  \n\
https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2309.02538\n\n",
  FontSize->16,
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nThe program reads the weights, biases, and scale factors for a 3-layer \
neural network trained on the 25 datasets in the reference above.  It then \
makes predictions for molecular targets not in the training set. \n\nThe \
network inputs are: number of atoms in a molecule\nThe network outputs are: \
ionization cross section at preset grid of 101 incident projectile energies \
between 25 and 100 eV.\n\nRequired input files are stored in the directory \
weights.biases.all25.mols.400.epochs.  \n\nThe user needs to provide the \
network inputs of number of C, H, N, O atoms in the molecule, as well as a \
name for the predictions output file, at the appropriate place below in the \
code.  Search for \[OpenCurlyQuote]user defined\[CloseCurlyQuote].\n\n\
Predictions will be placed into a csv file with the user name provided in the \
working directory of this code.  \n\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.900934166615833*^9, 3.9009341902388077`*^9}, {
  3.9009342241452255`*^9, 3.900934475041476*^9}, {3.900934930700446*^9, 
  3.9009349509088936`*^9}, {3.900935103514579*^9, 3.900935169859147*^9}, {
  3.9009357728825226`*^9, 3.900935821042775*^9}, {3.9009358749944887`*^9, 
  3.9009359406851625`*^9}, {3.901383242591177*^9, 3.9013832841193056`*^9}, {
  3.901387421259863*^9, 3.9013875746066628`*^9}, {3.9013876060342693`*^9, 
  3.9013876115619283`*^9}, {3.901388781901311*^9, 3.9013887883576293`*^9}, {
  3.902698052185273*^9, 3.902698077470066*^9}, {3.902698341111205*^9, 
  3.9026983498518496`*^9}, {3.9028382755957527`*^9, 3.902838294287795*^9}, {
  3.903041362177677*^9, 
  3.903041373317706*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f5a1fe91-ea18-4ef2-91bd-\
c44574fb9109"],

